[DESCRIPTION]
SYSTEM: ASC
DEPLOY - ASC ONLY

Draws the contacts tab for the policy center on the ASC.
[END DESCRIPTION]

[HISTORY]
05/08/2007 - HMI-C10880 - Removed notice about required contacts, and added history section
05/24/2007 - HMI-C11072 - Update to dtp contacts table.
07/05/2007 - MSAEC (11228) - Changed to look at enabled flag to see whether a contact is editable.
01/23/2013 - PCO-C26877 - Remove hyperlink for Producer, CSR, and Accounting/Billing. Replaced CnEdit with canChange in changelink logic.
05/06/2016 - MR-C35497-004 - Increase size of CREATEDBY & MODIFIEDBY to accept an integer user id
04/03/2019 - MAG-C43669 - Changed stored procedure CONTACTSLIST_LISTSQL_SECTION to up_contacts_tablist
08/29/2019 - ADA-C40570 - Enhanced security by adding Parameters and Redirect Sections.
08/10/2023 - LAC-53366-003 - Added single quotes around SESSION ID.
[END HISTORY]

[SPECS]
TITLE=Contacts Add/Edit
BANNER=N
BOX=N
NODIM=N
NOSAVE=Y
MORESET=Y
PARAMETERS=D
DEBUG=N
USEMAP=N

SEARCHFIELDS=Y
LISTSQL=@GETSECTION
LISTBREAKLIST_DESCRIP
LISTBREAKCOLUMNS=2
SUBLIST=CONTACTSLIST
LISTONLY=N
LISTCOUNT=N
LISTINDENT=100%
DELETEsp=up_contacts_deleteContact
REDIRECT=GETSECTION
[END SPECS]

[REDIRECT_SECTION]
VAR$QL:
declare @ret varchar(8000),
        @message varchar(8000)

select @ret = '',
       @message = ''

exec up_asc_isValidRequest $USERID, '$SESSIONID', '$AGENCY', '', @ret output, @message output